From b73974fabf89f7e6586cace4d59c38395057f368 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:21:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camera: A flash button for the flash LED: off, light with a
 dimmer, flash

Phones have a flash LED next to the back cameras. The button picks what it
does: off, a lamp whose brightness a slider sets, or a flash that lights the
scene shortly before a picture is taken. The lamp is lit only while a back
camera is looked through, and goes out with the gallery, a locked screen or
the app.

The LED is the leds class device Phosh uses as torch (*:torch, *:flash),
switched through logind's Session.SetBrightness; without one, the button
stays hidden.
